  kw:"NITI Aayog DPI@2047 digital public infrastructure DPI 2.0 DPI 3.0 Viksit Bharat Frontier Tech Hub Aadhaar UPI ABDM MSME agriculture credit decentralised energy AI EkStep Deloitte roadmap 2026"
